  "totalBlocks": 88,
  "translatedBlocks": 87,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "570e82ec54ff861a",
      "translationZh": "Java 开发者不再需要依赖特定于 Java 框架的方法，就能从企业应用中调用 AI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa830e80d935dc51",
      "translationZh": "诚然，Langchain4j 让开发者摆脱了对特定 AI 供应商的直接依赖，赋予了开发者更多自主权，但你仍然依赖 Langchain4j。而使用 Spring AI 时，嗯，即便不依赖 Spring 本身，你当然也要依赖 Spring 所做的设计选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d7be25696229df2",
      "translationZh": "如今，GitHub Copilot SDK for Java 成为首个真正与框架无关、可从 Java 中调用 AI 的方案。而且，凭借其 BYOK 支持，GitHub Copilot SDK for Java 也不受特定 AI 供应商的约束。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d3745cac74731c3c",
      "translationZh": "💡 尽管它名为 GitHub Copilot SDK，但只要传入一个 provider / ProviderConfig，并提供你自己的 baseUrl + apiKey（或 bearer token），就可以将它与任何直接模型提供商搭配使用，例如 OpenAI、Azure、Anthropic，或兼容 OpenAI 的端点。无需订阅 Copilot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "67de14cf5da92cf2",
      "translationZh": "GitHub Copilot SDK for Java 是一个客户端库，让你的服务端 Java 代码能够创建 Copilot 智能体会话、注册工具、发送提示词并接收结构化响应——所有操作均可通过编程完成。它适用于包括 Jakarta EE 和 Spring 在内的服务端环境。只要你有过一段时间的企业级 Java 开发经历，这个 SDK 就会让你倍感熟悉：CompletableFuture、注解、Lambda 表达式、虚拟线程，应有尽有。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a369385a4c2beaa",
      "translationZh": "本文将展示如何使用该 SDK，带你逐步了解一个完整的 Jakarta EE 11 示例应用，并提供具体的后续步骤，供你亲自尝试。我选择 Jakarta EE 11 进行演示，是因为我曾担任该版本的首席发布协调人。我相信，开放标准是赋予开发者自主权的最佳方式。有关 Jakarta EE 11 的更多信息，请参阅这篇 InfoQ 文章。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ce259482944269f",
      "translationZh": "这个示例应用是一个使用 Jakarta EE 11 构建的智能体运行框架。当然，开发者也可以使用自己选择的、广为人知的 Java 框架和库，构建自己的智能体运行框架。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e2d736ba477d5615",
      "translationZh": "克隆示例应用，亲自尝试 >",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3f374fc0f9aaa8a8",
      "translationZh": "该 SDK 可作为 Maven 依赖项使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c870d7b962b22dab",
      "translationZh": "JDK 17 或 25（推荐使用 25——可启用虚拟线程及其他现代功能）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9603f37181f7da6c",
      "translationZh": "一个具有有效 Copilot 订阅的 GitHub 账户",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "02049e927b685458",
      "translationZh": "在本地安装 1.0.71 或更高版本的 Copilot CLI。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7177307932784324",
      "translationZh": "逐步了解示例应用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a433177fd8684b7",
      "translationZh": "了解 SDK 实际运行效果的最佳方式是运行这个示例应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7b9d525cc79e5bdd",
      "translationZh": "该 Java 演示基于以下技术构建：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aade1cf153965f6c",
      "translationZh": "适用于 Java 的 Copilot SDK 1.0.7-preview.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fb8f2bc3e31737f",
      "translationZh": "H2 内存数据库（10 条初始房源记录）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4822c3633ab5c658",
      "translationZh": "该应用是一个用于房地产销售线索管理的智能体流水线。客户提交咨询（“我想在伦敦找一套价格低于 £800,000 的三卧室住宅”），系统便会在一个虚拟线程上启动一个隔离的 Copilot Agent，通过流水线处理该咨询：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "288b45078a904515",
      "translationZh": "该架构使用 Jakarta WebSocket 将实时状态更新从服务器推送到浏览器，因此你可以在模型调用工具时，观察智能体在各个阶段的处理进度：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e6a64130ebb5c39",
      "translationZh": "同时提交多条咨询，即可看到基于虚拟线程的智能体并发运行。每个智能体都使用各自的 Copilot 会话独立处理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7bc07802f36a42d0",
      "translationZh": "SDK 功能实战",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5478bba2f3e916c",
      "translationZh": "让我们结合示例代码，逐一了解其中的关键 SDK 功能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a5e4f3ca6900f749",
      "translationZh": "使用 @CopilotTool 定义工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "522dbbe1014642ff",
      "translationZh": "这是最重磅的 API。如果你曾在 JAX-RS 中编写过 @GET 端点，或编写过 @MessageDriven bean，你会立刻感到熟悉：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "699d8c3e2ce4f783",
      "translationZh": "@CopilotTool 注解将该方法声明为模型可以调用的工具。@CopilotToolParam 注解描述每个参数，让模型知道该传入什么。SDK 负责所有 JSON Schema 生成、参数解析和调用分发工作。你只需编写一个普通的 Java 方法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9802ec0e212ec179",
      "translationZh": "使用 @CopilotTool 有两个构建前提条件。基于注解的工具 API 目前是 SDK 的实验性功能，因此你需要在 Maven 构建中配置两项内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e57b70c3d2ef2ab1",
      "translationZh": "启用实验性 API：向编译器传入 -Acopilot.experimental.allowed=true。如果没有这个标志，注解处理器将拒绝生成工具元数据。有关实验性 API 的更多详情，请参阅 Copilot SDK 文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90ce2abbc0bb7166",
      "translationZh": "注册注解处理器：将 SDK 添加为 annotationProcessorPath，使编译器能够找到 @CopilotTool 处理器，并在编译时生成 CopilotToolMeta 类。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "09eb8fbd570c5757",
      "translationZh": "这两项都在 maven-compiler-plugin 中配置：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ea0b34b1887e81c1",
      "translationZh": "要注册某个对象中所有带注解的工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "76757768414d3422",
      "translationZh": "使用 ToolDefinition.from(...) 定义内联 lambda 工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2dbcd41646986b9",
      "translationZh": "如果你想在调用处定义工具，而不为其编写专门的方法，可以使用 lambda 风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5faa1c6fa5925847",
      "translationZh": "注意 .overridesBuiltInTool(true)。它告诉 SDK，我们的 report_intent 工具有意替换同名的内置工具。当你需要为模型已经了解的工具定制行为时，这会很有用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9805924d8b033f58",
      "translationZh": "跨类工具扫描",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2554bdbef994e03d",
      "translationZh": "工具不必与智能体逻辑放在同一个类中。下面的 searchProperties 定义在一个单独的 CDI bean 中：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6e2361342d81d9f7",
      "translationZh": "通常，你会使用 ToolDefinition.fromObject(propertyDatabase) 来注册这些工具。在示例应用中，我们改用 lambda 包装器，因为 CDI 客户端代理可能会遮蔽注解元数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a00f2dda2a12b912",
      "translationZh": "自定义系统消息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b203aa5076cf65b6",
      "translationZh": "SDK 允许你对系统消息进行细粒度控制。使用 SystemMessageMode.CUSTOMIZE 可以替换特定部分，同时保留其余内容：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "075bd68e1b13db9b",
      "translationZh": "文本块（\"\"\"...\"\"\"）无需字符串拼接，就能让多行提示词保持易读。对 IDENTITY 部分的覆盖只会替换模型的自我描述，而不会影响安全护栏。如果你更喜欢简单一些的方式，SystemMessageMode.APPEND 会将你的内容添加到默认系统消息之后，而不替换任何内容。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "206793d5d1f2513a",
      "translationZh": "智能体循环：sendAndWait(...)",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77da4b36ba32237a",
      "translationZh": "一行代码即可启动完整的智能体循环：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11a28fc90afddc46",
      "translationZh": "在 .get() 背后，模型会进行推理、调用你的工具（可能多次），并返回最终响应。在虚拟线程上，.get() 的开销很低。等待期间不会占用平台线程。SDK 会自动将工具调用分派给你注册的处理程序，并将结果反馈给模型，直到模型完成任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "8d8e9a448808b463",
      "translationZh": "使用 session.on(...) 实时处理事件",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b982ac50f114cf42",
      "translationZh": "每次工具调用、每个结果、每条助手消息都会触发一个事件。示例应用会捕获这些事件，并通过 Jakarta WebSocket 将其推送到浏览器，让流水线仪表板实时更新。你可以使用模式匹配来处理特定的事件类型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "dbd7b67f6717f1d7",
      "translationZh": "无头客户端与权限处理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ba72feb290c3a6a",
      "translationZh": "客户端配置为在服务器端运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49b2877ac24d8edd",
      "translationZh": "CopilotClientMode.EMPTY 表示不集成 IDE——客户端直接与 Copilot CLI 通信。自定义 Executor（下文讨论）可确保工具回调在容器上下文中运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5c39f304da6d7a68",
      "translationZh": "在权限处理方面，示例使用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1cf1120383bb9c0",
      "translationZh": "APPROVE_ALL 适用于演示和开发。在生产环境中，应实现真正的权限策略，验证允许模型调用哪些工具。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4f9b1793e2ac179b",
      "translationZh": "Jakarta EE 集成模式",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "433f69b94faa868a",
      "translationZh": "该 SDK 并非框架孤岛。它可以自然地与 Jakarta EE 组合使用——当然，也能与 Spring 等专有框架组合使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "16aef3df84b68a07",
      "translationZh": "Executor 参数是关键的集成点。Jakarta Concurrency（3.1 规范的 §5.2）要求，应用程序创建的线程必须通过 ManagedThreadFactory 获取，以便容器能够：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5bfd96383547ef48",
      "translationZh": "跟踪线程，以便在生命周期结束时将其关闭（@PreDestroy / 服务器停止）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be40925c51dd12b2",
      "translationZh": "应用并发约束和策略",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62bde7cc1db7ffb0",
      "translationZh": "自动传播上下文（无需手动使用 contextualRunnable）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b8c92ae4893f06eb",
      "translationZh": "Open Liberty 26.x 支持通过 server.xml 中的 virtual 属性使用基于虚拟线程的 ManagedThreadFactory。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c33111cb00feb772",
      "translationZh": "然后，我们在 AppState.java 中注入该工厂：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bfa5dd9d1f9cffd6",
      "translationZh": "并用它创建传递给 Copilot SDK 的 Executor。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b6ee8772c022235",
      "translationZh": "这会创建携带容器上下文的虚拟线程。当 SDK 将工具调用分派给 searchProperties() 时，该方法可以通过 @Inject 注入 JPA 仓储并查询数据库，因为回调线程上存在容器上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7e7a456bb6c1b657",
      "translationZh": "示例中的其他集成模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "56bd1b880779f7f1",
      "translationZh": "对单例 CopilotClient 使用 CDI @ApplicationScoped（每个应用生命周期内只有一个客户端）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2190c645491cfb44",
      "translationZh": "使用 Jakarta Faces f:websocket 推送，通过 PushContext 实时更新浏览器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a0e7eb8908f34989",
      "translationZh": "使用 Jakarta Data @Repository 进行类型安全的数据库查询，无需编写原生 JPA 样板代码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7823cd19210934e",
      "translationZh": "通过 ToolSet 实现细粒度的工具访问控制。SessionConfig 让你能够精确指定每个会话可以访问哪些工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dd63034dd3841143",
      "translationZh": "这是生产环境中需要重点考虑的问题。你不是开放所有内置工具（文件系统访问、shell 执行等），而是仅显式启用智能体所需的工具。在示例应用中，我们允许使用所有自定义工具以及 web_fetch，以便智能体在 Search 阶段查询实时房产信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ca6d702bce1847ac",
      "translationZh": "Java 原生 API：CompletableFuture、注解、lambda 表达式和虚拟线程让 SDK 用起来符合 Java 的惯用风格，而不像是从另一种语言移植过来的敷衍之作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "25dc70974758b123",
      "translationZh": "三种工具定义方式：用注解适配企业级模式，用 lambda 表达式方便地进行内联定义，用 JSON Schema 实现完全控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "768bf13d5da4cc85",
      "translationZh": "系统消息自定义：通过分节覆盖，精确控制智能体的行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f09f390ace66cf83",
      "translationZh": "一行代码实现智能体循环：sendAndWait(...) 自动处理完整的工具调用循环。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fbb74ee2eb38c876",
      "translationZh": "实时事件流：session.on(...) 支持构建响应灵敏的用户界面并实现可观测性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a53c7049f68981e6",
      "translationZh": "服务端无头运行：无需 IDE；只要环境中有 Copilot CLI，就能运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4387fb6396798702",
      "translationZh": "与 Jakarta EE 自然组合：CDI、JPA、WebSocket 和虚拟线程都通过 Executor 集成点协同工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "afd5fea90a330a13",
      "translationZh": "探索 BYOK 支持。通过传入带有你自己的 baseUrl + apiKey（或持有者令牌）的 provider / ProviderConfig，GitHub Copilot SDK 可以直接对接模型提供商，例如 OpenAI、Azure、Anthropic，或兼容 OpenAI 的端点。无需订阅 Copilot。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fe05df1cc06dbe8b",
      "translationZh": "克隆示例应用并在本地运行。同时提交多个咨询请求，看看虚拟线程如何发挥作用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "54d3def84766168a",
      "translationZh": "切换模型。试用 session.setModel(...)，体验不同的 Copilot 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "110077ddfee38ded",
      "translationZh": "添加你自己的工具。定义一个新的 @CopilotTool 方法（例如房贷计算器或学区查询工具），看看智能体如何发现并使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0fe892f9d73008bc",
      "translationZh": "部署到 Azure。Open Liberty 在 Azure App Service、AKS 或 Azure Container Apps 上都能出色运行。请参阅 https://aka.ms/java/ee 上的 Jakarta EE on Azure 指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2d999a4ce6a5212",
      "translationZh": "Copilot SDK for Java 将 GitHub Copilot 的全部能力引入你的 Java 代码，无需 IDE，也不会被框架绑定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12d719a73d122260",
      "translationZh": "Ed Burns 是一名首席软件工程师，致力于为 Microsoft 和 GitHub 技术带来符合 Java 惯用方式的体验。Ed 自 1997 年起就一直从事 Java 相关工作，涉及从客户端到服务器，再到云和 AI 的各个方面。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2a8ac4db741d2fbb",
      "translationZh": "ReviewBench：面向 AI 代码审查的开放基准",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eee6f0b4ef8821b3",
      "translationZh": "我们正在推出 ReviewBench，这是一个面向代码审查智能体的基准，以具有代表性的 GitHub 拉取请求、多来源真实参考标准、经过校准的评估以及与生产环境需求相契合的指标为基础构建。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "218b7700c079d7e4",
      "translationZh": "AI 正在改变开发者的工作。以下三项技能值得加强。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b574241add52aba3",
      "translationZh": "学会指挥 AI 智能体、批判性地审查其输出，并始终将技术判断置于工作流程的核心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "02148c26d25f1759",
      "translationZh": "GitHub Copilot app 新手指南：如何使用画布构建自定义工作流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b901abedfe806325",
      "translationZh": "用日常英语描述你需要的界面，然后让智能体构建一个既能使用又能更新的实时交互界面——这样，你就能少花些时间适应工具，多花些时间完成工作。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "de2f5df501715016",
      "translationZh": "我们也有电子通讯",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "beda6f95cd21cbf7",
      "translationZh": "在我们专为开发者打造、每两周一期的电子通讯中，发现实用技巧、技术指南和最佳实践。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
